1
00:00:00,644 --> 00:00:03,064
LEONARD: Hey.
- Leonard, where are you?

2
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:05,190
(Leonard(running down stairs):)I'm at work.

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,570
At 6:30 in the morning?

4
00:00:08,402 --> 00:00:09,572
(Leonard:)Yes.

5
00:00:10,112 --> 00:00:11,192
(Sheldon:)On Sunday?

6
00:00:12,406 --> 00:00:13,536
(Leonard:)Yes.

7
00:00:13,991 --> 00:00:16,081
- Why?
- They asked me to come in.

8
00:00:16,452 --> 00:00:20,622
- Well, I didn't hear the phone ring.
- They texted me.

9
00:00:21,415 --> 00:00:24,835
(Sheldon:)Well, as I predicted, I am sick.

10
00:00:25,002 --> 00:00:28,542
(Sheldon:)My fever has been tracking up
exponentially since 2a. m...

11
00:00:28,714 --> 00:00:31,714
(Sheldon:)...and I am producing sputum
at an alarming rate.

12
00:00:31,884 --> 00:00:34,094
[SHELDON COUGHING]

13
00:00:34,261 --> 00:00:37,141
- No kidding.
- Nope. Not only that...

14
00:00:37,306 --> 00:00:41,146
(Sheldon:)...it has shifted from clear
to milky green.

15
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:44,560
All right, well, get some rest
and drink plenty of fluids.

16
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:49,570
(Sheldon:)What else would I drink?
Gases? Solids? Ionized plasma?

17
00:00:50,152 --> 00:00:51,482
(Leonard:)Drink whatever you want.

18
00:00:51,654 --> 00:00:53,944
- I want soup.
- Then make soup.

19
00:00:54,115 --> 00:00:56,825
- We don't have soup.
- I'm at work, Sheldon.

20
00:00:56,992 --> 00:01:00,022
[DOG BARKING]

